                "headline": "Blizzard Warning issued November 11 at 2:00PM AKST until November 13 at 4:00PM AKST by NWS Fairbanks AK",
                "description": "* WHAT...Blizzard conditions. Additional snow accumulations between 1\nand 3 inches. Winds gusting as high as 50 mph.\n\n* WHERE...Northern Arctic Coast.\n\n* WHEN...Until 4 PM AKST Friday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Travel could be difficult. Snow and blowing snow could\nreduce visibility below one half mile at times. Periods of blizzard\nconditions will be intermittently possible.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Winds will be strongest on Saturday with gusts\nas high as 60 mph possible.",
